{"title":"2007 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The larger of two consecutive odd integers is three times the smaller. What is their sum?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/3/a43fd44d5d1be5230ec42fc0d5e5da2d986d5b3f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}\\ 4\\qquad \\mathrm{(B)}\\ 8\\qquad \\mathrm{(C)}\\ 12\\qquad \\mathrm{(D)}\\ 16\\qquad \\mathrm{(E)}\\ 20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"372\" height=\"20\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> be the smaller term. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/d/32d8eac347d6f74ac4e4b27bb62e1e2bfa4a50eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n+2=3n \\Longrightarrow 2n = 2 \\Longrightarrow n=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"261\" height=\"14\" />\n</p>\n<ul><li>Thus, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/3/d93d79665d53ff3017f39016c6b611b578af4dc9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1+(1+2)=4 \\mathrm{(A)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"145\" height=\"18\" /></li></ul>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>By trial and error, 1 and 3 work. 1+3=4.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A\" title=\"2007 AMC 12A\">2007 AMC 12A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2007 AMC 12A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2007 AMC 12A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2007 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2007 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2007 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2007 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2007 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2007 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2007 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2007 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2007 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2007 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2007 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?titl